<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/glossary#sovereign-default">Glossary</a> · Term</p><h1 class="enc-title">Sovereign default</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as bankruptcies</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">A sovereign default is a failure by a government to repay its debts. The Spanish crown defaulted repeatedly in the sixteenth and seventeenth centuries. These bankruptcies, caused by the costs of continual wars, undermined long-term military capacity.</p></div>
